      "statement": "cli.py serve runs a one-time import_ini (INI [Playwright] sections into Task rows, created disabled with a default monthly cron, only while the Task table is empty) then starts the UI; cli.py run delegates to runner.run_task and returns its exit code; Playwright is lazy-imported only on the run path.",
