    {
      "id": "claim_ef23daea778f47d7a72b30d4f19e8a0a",
      "statement": "runner.run_task executes one task run in the order: load Task, validate the recipe with CheckRecipe (exit 1 if invalid), allocate a display, create the Run row recording its own pid plus display and novnc_port, start the Xvfb/x11vnc/websockify stack, run the vault preflight, run the recipe, then in teardown stop the display stack, finalize the Run row with a terminal result and ended_at, set the task to idle, and release the display in the outermost finally; it returns exit 0 only when result == 'success' and 1 for every other terminal result and pre-check failure.",
