    {
      "id": "claim_47d047717ef24ca2b3be9ab29dd401c5",
      "statement": "The runner's step retry budget is set by step_attempts: graceful steps are single-attempt (never retried, never paused; their failure is recorded and the run continues) while non-graceful steps re-execute the full method chain up to MAX_STEP_ATTEMPTS = 3 before failing; RunInterrupted is re-raised rather than treated as a step failure to retry.",
