      "statement": "Each executed step records exactly one PageStatus row (locator_action JSON, interactive_elements scan, error) plus a step screenshot under data/runs/<run_id>/ (top-level step_{n}.png, nested step_{parent}_{n}.png); a screenshot failure is logged and never aborts the run.",
